    <p><a href="/">Sites On Call</a> builds websites for service businesses in Madison and the broader North Alabama area. The website itself is free with an annual content plan. If you want monthly flexibility, plans start at $149/month. No contracts. Cancel anytime. <a href="/articles/contractor-website-design/">More on what a real contractor website looks like here.</a></p>

    <p>What we don't build: templated single-page sites with "I'm a contractor in Madison, please call me" copy. Those don't rank, they don't convert, and the Madison customer specifically doesn't trust them. What we do build: 10 to 20 pages of substantive content covering your actual services, your real service area (Madison plus neighboring cities you cover), the specific problems your customers search for, and the portfolio depth that lets a due-diligence buyer confirm you know what you're doing. The Madison customer does their homework before they call. The website has to survive that homework.</p>

